# Dogfood scheduler (runtime/scheduler.py), also used by `make dev`. Times are UTC.
# Every entry starts one short-lived `run-task <kind>` process for a kind registered in
# backend/src/property_focus/runtime/scheduled.py; nothing here loops or waits for work.
# backend/tests/unit/test_runtime_manifests.py enforces both rules.
#
# min  hour  day  month  weekday  command
*      *     *    *      *        python -m property_focus.cli run-task outbox-sweep
*/5    *     *    *      *        python -m property_focus.cli run-task repair
